1
00:00:00,386 --> 00:00:02,386
(Leonard:)She could have
any guy she wants.

2
00:00:02,388 --> 00:00:04,018
(Leonard:)Which is probably why

3
00:00:04,023 --> 00:00:06,793
(Leonard:)it took her so many years
to tell me she loved me.

4
00:00:06,792 --> 00:00:09,292
(Mandy:)Maybe you should talk
to a therapist about this.

5
00:00:09,295 --> 00:00:11,625
(Leonard:)Too expensive.

6
00:00:13,465 --> 00:00:16,565
(Leonard:)You'd think I'd be used to women
withholding their love.

7
00:00:16,568 --> 00:00:17,898
(Leonard:)I mean, my mother did.

8
00:00:17,903 --> 00:00:19,703
(Leonard:)I mean, no matter
how hard I tried,

9
00:00:19,705 --> 00:00:21,805
(Leonard:)she just didn't have
any interest in me.

10
00:00:21,807 --> 00:00:24,377
(Mandy:)Imagine that.

11
00:00:24,376 --> 00:00:26,106
(Leonard:)I wonder if that's why I have

12
00:00:26,111 --> 00:00:28,481
(Leonard:)such a dysfunctional
relationship with Sheldon.

13
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:29,880
(Leonard:)I had a dream

14
00:00:29,882 --> 00:00:32,582
(Leonard:)the other night that
I was in a cave

15
00:00:32,584 --> 00:00:35,584
(Leonard:)and I was nursing a baby,

16
00:00:35,587 --> 00:00:39,657
(Leonard:)but the baby
had Sheldon's head on it.

17
00:00:41,527 --> 00:00:44,557
(Mandy:)And your wife is worried
about me?

18
00:00:45,297 --> 00:00:46,567
KOOTHRAPPALI:
Hey, Leonard!

19
00:00:46,565 --> 00:00:47,735
(Raj:)When you're done,

20
00:00:47,733 --> 00:00:50,503
(Raj:)we came up with
a bunch more.

21
00:00:53,706 --> 00:00:56,106
(Sheldon(on screen):)Then the Czech Republic
says to Slovakia,

22
00:00:56,108 --> 00:00:58,708
"I don't think you understand
how being broken up works!"

23
00:00:58,711 --> 00:01:00,711
(Sheldon(on screen):)Can you believe that?

